{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "ch4ss33lmwva02mm", "title": "62.分布式训练中的梯度累积实现原理", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h3 data-lake-id=\"83d4d33c\" id=\"83d4d33c\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf61d0ffb\" id=\"uf61d0ffb\">一、答题思路</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u29a9de44\" id=\"u29a9de44\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1752370681903-321d6a7b-5bef-4258-8e1b-b4b04127e905.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u878ff795-d030-4b8f-a0bc-92f97a047b9%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uedd4c472-6534-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A399.13336181640625%2C%22height%22%3A147%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A34968%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A559%2C%22originHeight%22%3A206%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A2%AF%E5%BA%A6%E5%BB%B6%E8%BF%9F%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%22%2C%22x%22%3A427%2C%22y%22%3A48%2C%22width%22%3A114%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%98%BE%E5%AD%98%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%22%2C%22x%22%3A427%2C%22y%22%3A144%2C%22width%22%3A81%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%A4%A7%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E6%8B%86%E5%88%86%22%2C%22x%22%3A426%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A2%AF%E5%BA%A6%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%E6%80%A7%22%2C%22x%22%3A425%2C%22y%22%3A110%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%93%BE%E5%BC%8F%E6%B3%95%E5%88%99%22%2C%22x%22%3A424%2C%22y%22%3A82%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%22%2C%22x%22%3A50%2C%22y%22%3A96%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%AD%E7%BB%83%E7%A8%B3%E5%AE%9A%22%2C%22x%22%3A427%2C%22y%22%3A173%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E4%BC%98%E5%8A%BF%22%2C%22x%22%3A239%2C%22y%22%3A159%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A238%2C%22y%22%3A95%2C%22width%22%3A82%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%80%9D%E6%83%B3%22%2C%22x%22%3A241%2C%22y%22%3A33%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f7f6%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u71145d98%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9417129c\" id=\"u9417129c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u45cac214\" id=\"u45cac214\">梯度累积</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9823fd9d\" id=\"u9823fd9d\">是分布式训练中解决显存限制的核心技术之一，其本质是通过延迟梯度更新来模拟大批次训练效果。以下从原理、案例、实现细节三个维度展开分析：</span></p><ol list=\"u317038b0\"><li fid=\"u84d8c53f\" data-lake-id=\"u2185d6b3\" id=\"u2185d6b3\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8888172b\" id=\"u8888172b\">原理层面</span></strong></li></ol><ul list=\"u1e6acbc4\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"uf058d61e\" data-lake-id=\"u26533a72\" id=\"u26533a72\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u94f4f052\" id=\"u94f4f052\">核心思想</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u571a7a48\" id=\"u571a7a48\">：将单个大批次的梯度计算拆分为多个小批次，逐次累积梯度后再更新参数。 </span></li><li fid=\"uf058d61e\" data-lake-id=\"u323c0a7b\" id=\"u323c0a7b\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufd6a4fd7\" id=\"ufd6a4fd7\">数学推导</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u87c106b4\" id=\"u87c106b4\">：通过链式法则保证梯度一致性，避免因累积导致的梯度偏差。</span></li><li fid=\"uf058d61e\" data-lake-id=\"udd19fd6c\" id=\"udd19fd6c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u216a8bc1\" id=\"u216a8bc1\">优势</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6ec3d36a\" id=\"u6ec3d36a\">：降低显存占用、提升训练稳定性、支持更大规模模型训练。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u317038b0\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u84d8c53f\" data-lake-id=\"u214964f4\" id=\"u214964f4\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6e2a3b8a\" id=\"u6e2a3b8a\">项目案例</span></strong></li></ol><ul list=\"ubff5ed3e\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"uc3f92601\" data-lake-id=\"u32f979aa\" id=\"u32f979aa\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2f4c2d1c\" id=\"u2f4c2d1c\">场景</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uec472b80\" id=\"uec472b80\">：医疗文本分类任务（如中文电子病历的疾病分类）。</span></li><li fid=\"uc3f92601\" data-lake-id=\"u48faa9b0\" id=\"u48faa9b0\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1666ba66\" id=\"u1666ba66\">痛点</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u68d06624\" id=\"u68d06624\">： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"ubff5ed3e\" data-lake-indent=\"2\"><li fid=\"u25f932a0\" data-lake-id=\"u356aedc4\" id=\"u356aedc4\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub542a249\" id=\"ub542a249\">单个GPU显存不足（如16GB显存无法加载175B参数模型）； </span></li><li fid=\"u25f932a0\" data-lake-id=\"uceacb38e\" id=\"uceacb38e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua0ee6313\" id=\"ua0ee6313\">训练数据量大（百万级样本），传统小批次训练收敛慢；</span></li><li fid=\"u25f932a0\" data-lake-id=\"u04b19b6d\" id=\"u04b19b6d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud95a636c\" id=\"ud95a636c\">分布式训练通信开销大，跨节点同步效率低。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u317038b0\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u84d8c53f\" data-lake-id=\"ua9c89635\" id=\"ua9c89635\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc3037b50\" id=\"uc3037b50\">实现细节</span></strong></li></ol><ul list=\"ub824c1b2\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"uf89edd5b\" data-lake-id=\"ufc0b5d05\" id=\"ufc0b5d05\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ucc905af7\" id=\"ucc905af7\">代码实现</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua00ea713\" id=\"ua00ea713\">：以PyTorch为例，通过</span><code data-lake-id=\"u5d941b17\" id=\"u5d941b17\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0b581e26\" id=\"u0b581e26\">optimizer.zero_grad()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u4068bbe8\" id=\"u4068bbe8\">控制梯度清零时机。 </span></li><li fid=\"uf89edd5b\" data-lake-id=\"u4ac4a93d\" id=\"u4ac4a93d\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u948bc439\" id=\"u948bc439\">参数配置</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub33b6c83\" id=\"ub33b6c83\">：累积步数（</span><code data-lake-id=\"ub844bed2\" id=\"ub844bed2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaad56145\" id=\"uaad56145\">accumulation_steps</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3f5be229\" id=\"u3f5be229\">）与学习率、BatchSize的联动调整。</span></li><li fid=\"uf89edd5b\" data-lake-id=\"u73746253\" id=\"u73746253\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u82616615\" id=\"u82616615\">优化策略</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf5d1c1c7\" id=\"uf5d1c1c7\">：梯度裁剪、混合精度训练（FP16/FP32混合）减少内存占用。 </span></li></ul><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22L2NBk%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"6c12541a\" id=\"6c12541a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u54a39312\" id=\"u54a39312\">二、项目案例</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"udf11dfda\" id=\"udf11dfda\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1752370700848-676327b8-941d-47b7-ae76-ef3fe6d8e6d3.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u4fa1d6a6-fe2e-415f-89c4-40ecfef03cd%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uedd4c472-6534-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A492.8666687011719%2C%22height%22%3A115%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A23600%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A551%2C%22originHeight%22%3A129%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%97%85%E5%8E%86%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%22%2C%22x%22%3A429%2C%22y%22%3A6%2C%22width%22%3A86%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8C%BB%E7%96%97%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF%22%2C%22x%22%3A244%2C%22y%22%3A20%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9C%80%E6%B1%82%22%2C%22x%22%3A429%2C%22y%22%3A35%2C%22width%22%3A81%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A52%2C%22y%22%3A51%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%98%BE%E5%AD%98%E4%B8%8D%E8%B6%B3%22%2C%22x%22%3A427%2C%22y%22%3A69%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BC%A0%E7%BB%9F%E5%B1%80%E9%99%90%22%2C%22x%22%3A243%2C%22y%22%3A82%2C%22width%22%3A84%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%94%B6%E6%95%9B%E7%BC%93%E6%85%A2%22%2C%22x%22%3A426%2C%22y%22%3A97%2C%22width%22%3A86%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f6f6%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u47e89e99%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"c5d21af6\" id=\"c5d21af6\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u801ff441\" id=\"u801ff441\">案例背景：医疗文本分类系统</span></strong></h4><p data-lake-id=\"ua56e6238\" id=\"ua56e6238\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9cf4b004\" id=\"u9cf4b004\">某三甲医院需构建基于BERT的中文电子病历疾病分类系统，数据特点如下：</span></p><ul list=\"uf3281a3d\"><li fid=\"u9d919547\" data-lake-id=\"ubb763324\" id=\"ubb763324\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5c44fd1c\" id=\"u5c44fd1c\">数据规模</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u751f20c6\" id=\"u751f20c6\">：100万份病历，每份文本长度512 tokens；</span></li><li fid=\"u9d919547\" data-lake-id=\"u97e6e325\" id=\"u97e6e325\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud7157bf7\" id=\"ud7157bf7\">模型需求</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8573b563\" id=\"u8573b563\">：RoBERTa-wwm-large（175B参数）；</span></li><li fid=\"u9d919547\" data-lake-id=\"u4d224191\" id=\"u4d224191\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1598edab\" id=\"u1598edab\">硬件限制</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u16fcf4a7\" id=\"u16fcf4a7\">：单机8卡V100（每卡16GB显存）；</span></li><li fid=\"u9d919547\" data-lake-id=\"u0f9d59ad\" id=\"u0f9d59ad\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ucbfc2941\" id=\"ucbfc2941\">目标</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud0764567\" id=\"ud0764567\">：在有限显存下实现高效训练，保证模型精度。</span></li></ul><h4 data-lake-id=\"8a17d761\" id=\"8a17d761\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud2d07ab1\" id=\"ud2d07ab1\">传统训练的局限性</span></strong></h4><ol list=\"uad4ee34a\"><li fid=\"ud27d3ade\" data-lake-id=\"u758de05c\" id=\"u758de05c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u898586f0\" id=\"u898586f0\">显存爆炸</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u533862c0\" id=\"u533862c0\">：单卡无法加载完整模型参数，需降低BatchSize至8，导致训练不稳定； </span></li><li fid=\"ud27d3ade\" data-lake-id=\"u47d2b374\" id=\"u47d2b374\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7748cb07\" id=\"u7748cb07\">收敛速度慢</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u87ca4dc3\" id=\"u87ca4dc3\">：小批次梯度噪声大，需更多epoch达到收敛；</span></li><li fid=\"ud27d3ade\" data-lake-id=\"u9a9982b7\" id=\"u9a9982b7\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uead1622a\" id=\"uead1622a\">通信瓶颈</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u372fe84a\" id=\"u372fe84a\">：多机训练时梯度同步耗时占比超60%，GPU利用率不足40%。</span></li></ol><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ZdjTP%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"bd6c56ad\" id=\"bd6c56ad\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2019efb6\" id=\"u2019efb6\">三、参考回答</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ufa8c649c\" id=\"ufa8c649c\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1752370728622-dbace692-e828-46d6-843a-db1ba82594e5.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u3a16d775-acfb-4ebb-8f7f-1d546f81e13%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uedd4c472-6534-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A425.73333740234375%2C%22height%22%3A152%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A33292%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A547%2C%22originHeight%22%3A195%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%89%2C%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%22%2C%22x%22%3A9%2C%22y%22%3A82%2C%22width%22%3A122%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%AD%90%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E5%88%87%E5%88%86%22%2C%22x%22%3A426%2C%22y%22%3A6%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E5%99%A8%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%22%2C%22x%22%3A422%2C%22y%22%3A98%2C%22width%22%3A104%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A2%AF%E5%BA%A6%E8%A3%81%E5%89%AA%22%2C%22x%22%3A422%2C%22y%22%3A160%2C%22width%22%3A81%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%B7%B7%E5%90%88%E7%B2%BE%E5%BA%A6%22%2C%22x%22%3A421%2C%22y%22%3A132%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%22%2C%22x%22%3A237%2C%22y%22%3A82%2C%22width%22%3A81%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E7%AD%96%E7%95%A5%22%2C%22x%22%3A237%2C%22y%22%3A146%2C%22width%22%3A82%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%AD%A5%E6%95%B0%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%22%2C%22x%22%3A423%2C%22y%22%3A68%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%89%8D%E5%90%91%E4%BC%A0%E6%92%AD%22%2C%22x%22%3A239%2C%22y%22%3A20%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A2%AF%E5%BA%A6%E7%B4%AF%E7%A7%AF%22%2C%22x%22%3A423%2C%22y%22%3A34%2C%22width%22%3A81%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f7f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u5fe062f9%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"193d2821\" id=\"193d2821\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0c2c0cfe\" id=\"u0c2c0cfe\">梯度累积的实现原理</span></strong></h4><p data-lake-id=\"ub0a5e184\" id=\"ub0a5e184\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud0ed5661\" id=\"ud0ed5661\">梯度累积通过拆分Batch与延迟更新实现显存优化，具体流程如下：</span></p><ol list=\"u393aea8c\"><li fid=\"u7f7d95c9\" data-lake-id=\"u4f7458ea\" id=\"u4f7458ea\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u32b11888\" id=\"u32b11888\">前向传播（Forward Pass）</span></strong></li></ol><ul list=\"u311cbd60\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u51f31d44\" data-lake-id=\"u39ef14f1\" id=\"u39ef14f1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3f3c3aaf\" id=\"u3f3c3aaf\">输入数据按小批次（Sub-Batch）切分，如将原BatchSize=256拆分为8个子批次（Sub-BatchSize=32）。</span></li><li fid=\"u51f31d44\" data-lake-id=\"u93823deb\" id=\"u93823deb\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubfa9d1a6\" id=\"ubfa9d1a6\">每个子批次计算损失函数： </span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22for%20sub_batch%20in%20dataloader%3A%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20logits%20%3D%20model(sub_batch)%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20loss%20%3D%20criterion(logits%2C%20labels)%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E7%B4%AF%E7%A7%AF%E6%A2%AF%E5%BA%A6%E6%97%B6%E4%B8%8D%E7%AB%8B%E5%8D%B3%E6%B8%85%E9%9B%B6%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22q7FxB%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ol list=\"u393aea8c\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u7f7d95c9\" data-lake-id=\"u7a8bfc9e\" id=\"u7a8bfc9e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6c8d9f7b\" id=\"u6c8d9f7b\">梯度累积（Gradient Accumulation）</span></strong></li></ol><ul list=\"u1e8a0f07\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ua6e5a573\" data-lake-id=\"u9374d038\" id=\"u9374d038\"><span data-lake-id=\"u54d0744e\" id=\"u54d0744e\">在多个子批次后统一执行反向传播，梯度累加至优化器： </span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22if%20(step%20%2B%201)%20%25%20accumulation_steps%20%3D%3D%200%3A%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20loss.backward()%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20optimizer.step()%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20optimizer.zero_grad()%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22U8ynf%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"u1e8a0f07\" start=\"2\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ua6e5a573\" data-lake-id=\"ubebf88f2\" id=\"ubebf88f2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue2e7552c\" id=\"ue2e7552c\">关键点</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2fbbfefe\" id=\"u2fbbfefe\">：显存仅保存当前子批次的梯度，而非全部累积梯度。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u393aea8c\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u7f7d95c9\" data-lake-id=\"u86eb357a\" id=\"u86eb357a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0cdac1f4\" id=\"u0cdac1f4\">参数更新（Parameter Update）</span></strong></li></ol><ul list=\"u4e527a8d\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"uff754841\" data-lake-id=\"u9264e101\" id=\"u9264e101\"><span data-lake-id=\"u60c85ac9\" id=\"u60c85ac9\">累积指定步数后，执行一次参数更新，等效于大批次训练： </span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E7%AD%89%E6%95%88BatchSize%20%3D%20Sub-BatchSize%20*%20accumulation_steps%20%20%5Cneffective_batch_size%20%3D%2032%20*%208%20%3D%20256%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zYeHu%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h4 data-lake-id=\"181a13e6\" id=\"181a13e6\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u14239c60\" id=\"u14239c60\">案例中的梯度累积应用</span></strong></h4><p data-lake-id=\"ua44a741a\" id=\"ua44a741a\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1752370752741-7e5dc86c-c46e-4bd1-9df7-9031e2a24c95.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u3e620cd1-f9aa-425f-a733-67a132be0ff%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uedd4c472-6534-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A489.6000061035156%2C%22height%22%3A125%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png